 {
  "id": "790:925",
  "name": "2",
  "sec": "How to make your business loan file look strong before you even walk into a bank\"",
  "w": "1200",
  "h": "1500",
  "texts": [
   "capnix.ai",
   "02",
   "/10",
   "DPDP Compliance partner",
   "Separate personal and",
   "business expenses:",
   "If your personal spending and business spending are mixed in one account, lenders can't tell how healthy your business actually is. Keep them apart, always."
  ],
  "types": {
   "frame": 11,
   "ellipse": 7,
   "rounded-rectangle": 3,
   "text": 7,
   "vector": 1
  }
 },
 {
  "id": "790:963",
  "name": "1",
  "sec": "How to make your business loan file look strong before you even walk into a bank\"",
  "w": "1200",
  "h": "1500",
  "texts": [
   "capnix.ai",
   "Swipe to explore",
   "DPDP Compliance partner",
   "How to make your",
   "business loan file",
   "look strong",
   "before you even walk into a bank"
  ],
  "types": {
   "frame": 9,
   "ellipse": 2,
   "rounded-rectangle": 2,
   "text": 7,
   "vector": 4
  }
 },
 {
  "id": "790:983",
  "name": "3",
  "sec": "How to make your business loan file look strong before you even walk into a bank\"",
  "w": "1200",
  "h": "1500",
  "texts": [
   "capnix.ai",
   "03",
   "/10",
   "Match your Gst filings",
   "to your actual sales",
   "Lenders check GST returns closely. If your filed numbers don't match what you're claiming as revenue, that gap raises questions before you even explain anything.",
   "DPDP Compliance partner"
  ],
  "types": {
   "frame": 10,
   "rounded-rectangle": 3,
   "ellipse": 2,
   "text": 7,
   "vector": 1
  }
 },
 {
  "id": "790:1015",
  "name": "5",
  "sec": "How to make your business loan file look strong before you even walk into a bank\"",
  "w": "1200",
  "h": "1500",
  "texts": [
   "Have your last",
   "2 years of financials",
   "ready and consistent",
   "Profit and loss statements, balance sheets, they should tell one continuous story, not look patched together at the last minute.",
   "DPDP Compliance partner",
   "capnix.ai",
   "05",
   "/10"
  ],
  "types": {
   "frame": 10,
   "rounded-rectangle": 2,
   "text": 8,
   "vector": 1
  }
 },
 {
  "id": "790:1043",
  "name": "6",
  "sec": "How to make your business loan file look strong before you even walk into a bank\"",
  "w": "1200",
  "h": "1500",
  "texts": [
   "capnix.ai",
   "06",
   "/10",
   "Check your CIBIL Score",
   "before a lender does",
   "A low score isn't always disqualifying, but a surprise low score during review looks worse than one you already know about and can explain",
   "DPDP Compliance partner"
  ],
  "types": {
   "frame": 10,
   "rounded-rectangle": 3,
   "text": 7,
   "vector": 1,
   "ellipse": 1
  }
 },
 {
  "id": "790:1102",
  "name": "4",
  "sec": "How to make your business loan file look strong before you even walk into a bank\"",
  "w": "1200",
  "h": "1500",
  "texts": [
   "capnix.ai",
   "04",
   "/10",
   "Keep at least 12 months",
   "of clean bank statements",
   "Gaps, bounced payments, or erratic balances stand out immediately. A steady, explainable cash flow matters more than one great month.",
   "DPDP Compliance partner"
  ],
  "types": {
   "frame": 13,
   "ellipse": 2,
   "rounded-rectangle": 3,
   "text": 7,
   "vector": 1
  }
 },
 {
  "id": "793:1767",
  "name": "10",
  "sec": "How to make your business loan file look strong before you even walk into a bank\"",
  "w": "1200",
  "h": "1500",
  "texts": [
   "DPDP Compliance partner",
   "capnix.ai",
   "If you're an MSME owner, this is exactly what loan-ready means not just applying, but making sure your file already tells the right story before anyone reads it. We help businesses get to that point, and stay with them until they're actually funded, not just until the application is submitted.",
   "What's one thing you wish you'd known before your first loan application?"
  ],
  "types": {
   "frame": 7,
   "rounded-rectangle": 2,
   "ellipse": 4,
   "text": 4
  }
 },
 {
  "id": "793:1693",
  "name": "9",
  "sec": "How to make your business loan file look strong before you even walk into a bank\"",
  "w": "1200",
  "h": "1500",
  "texts": [
   "DPDP Compliance partner",
   "capnix.ai",
   "09",
   "/10",
   "A strong file doesn’t",
   "happen the night before",
   "you apply",
   "It's built over months, not days. Start early, and the bank meeting becomes a formality, not a gamble."
  ],
  "types": {
   "frame": 10,
   "rounded-rectangle": 2,
   "ellipse": 1,
   "text": 8,
   "vector": 1
  }
 },
 {
  "id": "793:1710",
  "name": "7",
  "sec": "How to make your business loan file look strong before you even walk into a bank\"",
  "w": "1200",
  "h": "1500",
  "texts": [
   "DPDP Compliance partner",
   "capnix.ai",
   "07",
   "/10",
   "Know exactly how much",
   "you need, and why",
   "Vague loan amounts make lenders nervous. A specific number tied to a specific business reason builds trust instantly."
  ],
  "types": {
   "frame": 10,
   "ellipse": 1,
   "rounded-rectangle": 2,
   "text": 7,
   "vector": 1
  }
 },
 {
  "id": "793:1738",
  "name": "8",
  "sec": "How to make your business loan file look strong before you even walk into a bank\"",
  "w": "1200",
  "h": "1500",
  "texts": [
   "DPDP Compliance partner",
   "capnix.ai",
   "08",
   "/10",
   "Be ready to explain any",
   "dip in revenue",
   "Every business has a bad quarter. Lenders don't expect perfection. They expect you to know why it happened and what's changed since."
  ],
  "types": {
   "frame": 10,
   "rounded-rectangle": 2,
   "ellipse": 1,
   "text": 7,
   "vector": 1
  }
 },
 {
