 {
  "id": "823:813",
  "name": "52",
  "sec": "How to prepare for a loan 3 months before you actually need the money",
  "w": "1200",
  "h": "1500",
  "texts": [
   "capnix.ai",
   "02",
   "/10",
   "DPDP Compliance partner",
   "Before 3 Months",
   "Check your",
   "CIBIL score first",
   "Before anything else, know where you stand. If it needs fixing, three months is enough time. Three days isn't."
  ],
  "types": {
   "frame": 15,
   "ellipse": 7,
   "rounded-rectangle": 4,
   "text": 8,
   "vector": 1
  }
 },
 {
  "id": "823:862",
  "name": "53",
  "sec": "How to prepare for a loan 3 months before you actually need the money",
  "w": "1200",
  "h": "1500",
  "texts": [
   "capnix.ai",
   "Swipe to explore",
   "DPDP Compliance partner",
   "How to prepare for a",
   "loan 3 months before",
   "you actually need the money"
  ],
  "types": {
   "frame": 8,
   "ellipse": 2,
   "rounded-rectangle": 2,
   "text": 6,
   "vector": 4
  }
 },
 {
  "id": "823:884",
  "name": "54",
  "sec": "How to prepare for a loan 3 months before you actually need the money",
  "w": "1200",
  "h": "1500",
  "texts": [
   "capnix.ai",
   "03",
   "/10",
   "Before 3 Months",
   "Pull together your",
   "last 2 years of financials",
   "Profit and loss, balance sheets, GST filings. Get them in one place now, so nothing is a last-minute scramble lat",
   "DPDP Compliance partner"
  ],
  "types": {
   "frame": 13,
   "rounded-rectangle": 3,
   "ellipse": 2,
   "text": 8,
   "vector": 1
  }
 },
 {
  "id": "823:925",
  "name": "55",
  "sec": "How to prepare for a loan 3 months before you actually need the money",
  "w": "1200",
  "h": "1500",
  "texts": [
   "Before 2 Months",
   "Decide exactly",
   "how much you need,",
   "and why",
   "Not a rough estimate. A specific number tied to a specific business reason, stock, equipment, expansion, working capital.",
   "DPDP Compliance partner",
   "capnix.ai",
   "05",
   "/10"
  ],
  "types": {
   "frame": 13,
   "rounded-rectangle": 3,
   "text": 9,
   "vector": 1
  }
 },
 {
  "id": "823:965",
  "name": "56",
  "sec": "How to prepare for a loan 3 months before you actually need the money",
  "w": "1200",
  "h": "1500",
  "texts": [
   "capnix.ai",
   "06",
   "/10",
   "Before 2 Months",
   "Shortlist the",
   "right lenders for",
   "your business type",
   "Not every lender fits every business. This is the month to compare, not the week you're desperate for an answer.",
   "DPDP Compliance partner"
  ],
  "types": {
   "frame": 13,
   "rounded-rectangle": 3,
   "text": 9,
   "vector": 1,
   "ellipse": 1
  }
 },
 {
  "id": "823:1006",
  "name": "57",
  "sec": "How to prepare for a loan 3 months before you actually need the money",
  "w": "1200",
  "h": "1500",
  "texts": [
   "capnix.ai",
   "04",
   "/10",
   "Before 3 Months",
   "Separate personal and",
   "business expenses",
   "If they're mixed, this is the time to clean it up. A messy account history takes weeks to sort, not hours.",
   "DPDP Compliance partner"
  ],
  "types": {
   "frame": 16,
   "ellipse": 2,
   "rounded-rectangle": 3,
   "text": 8,
   "vector": 1
  }
 },
 {
  "id": "823:1050",
  "name": "58",
  "sec": "How to prepare for a loan 3 months before you actually need the money",
  "w": "1200",
  "h": "1500",
  "texts": [
   "DPDP Compliance partner",
   "capnix.ai",
   "If you're an MSME owner, this is exactly what being loan-ready means, preparing well before the need shows up, not scrambling when it does. We help businesses get to that point, and stay with them until they're actually funded, not just until the application goes in.",
   "When did you last plan something 3 months ahead, instead of reacting when it became urgent?"
  ],
  "types": {
   "frame": 7,
   "rounded-rectangle": 3,
   "ellipse": 4,
   "text": 4
  }
 },
 {
  "id": "823:1070",
  "name": "59",
  "sec": "How to prepare for a loan 3 months before you actually need the money",
  "w": "1200",
  "h": "1500",
  "texts": [
   "DPDP Compliance partner",
   "capnix.ai",
   "09",
   "/10",
   "By the time you need",
   "the money, the process",
   "should already be done",
   "Not started. Done. That's the difference between planning and panicking."
  ],
  "types": {
   "frame": 10,
   "rounded-rectangle": 3,
   "ellipse": 1,
   "text": 8,
   "vector": 1
  }
 },
 {
  "id": "823:1095",
  "name": "60",
  "sec": "How to prepare for a loan 3 months before you actually need the money",
  "w": "1200",
  "h": "1500",
  "texts": [
   "DPDP Compliance partner",
   "capnix.ai",
   "07",
   "/10",
   "Before 1 Months",
   "Apply while you still",
   "have room to fix issues",
   "If something in your file needs correcting, a month gives you time to fix it and reapply. A week doesn't."
  ],
  "types": {
   "frame": 13,
   "ellipse": 1,
   "rounded-rectangle": 3,
   "text": 8,
   "vector": 1
  }
 },
 {
  "id": "823:1135",
  "name": "61",
  "sec": "How to prepare for a loan 3 months before you actually need the money",
  "w": "1200",
  "h": "1500",
  "texts": [
   "DPDP Compliance partner",
   "capnix.ai",
   "08",
   "/10",
   "Before 1 Months",
   "Keep your documents",
   "updated, not just ready",
   "Bank statements, GST returns, ID proofs, all should reflect the most recent month, not something pulled together three months ago."
  ],
  "types": {
   "frame": 13,
   "rounded-rectangle": 3,
   "ellipse": 1,
   "text": 8,
   "vector": 1
  }
 }
